MAME DAT Metadata reimplements the MAME release discovery, listxml parsing, and
compact indexing design from My Games Anywhere (MGA), Copyright 2026 GreenFuze
and contributors. MGA is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its
source is available at:
https://github.com/GreenFuze/MyGamesAnywhere

This project compiles against the Playnite SDK (MIT License, Copyright Josef
Nemec). The Playnite SDK assembly is supplied by the host and is not
redistributed in the extension package. Source and license:
https://github.com/JosefNemec/Playnite

At runtime, the plugin downloads the official MAME full listxml release asset
from the mamedev/mame GitHub repository and creates a local lookup index. MAME
is Copyright (c) 1997-2026 MAMEdev and contributors and is distributed under
the GNU General Public License version 2. MAME is a registered trademark of
Gregory Ember. The extension package contains no MAME program code, binaries,
ROM content, or listxml data. MAME source and licensing information:
https://github.com/mamedev/mame
https://github.com/mamedev/mame/blob/master/COPYING

The plugin creates outbound links to public Arcade Museum technical machine
pages. It does not fetch or redistribute Arcade Museum content. Arcade Museum
and related marks belong to their respective owners.

